@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@providerEmail = provider@example.com
@providerPassword = StrongProvider123!
@propertyId = replace-with-canonical-property-id

# Enable REST Client cookie persistence before running this file.

### Provider login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{providerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{providerPassword}}"
}

### Search for a canonical Property before creating another record
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties/possible-matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gulshan Residential Parking",
  "publicArea": "Gulshan 2, Dhaka",
  "exactAddress": "House 12, Road 45, Gulshan 2, Dhaka",
  "latitude": 23.7949,
  "longitude": 90.4143
}

### Create a new canonical Property and initial pending Provider membership
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gulshan Residential Parking",
  "publicArea": "Gulshan 2, Dhaka",
  "approximateAddress": "Near Gulshan 2 circle",
  "exactAddress": "House 12, Road 45, Gulshan 2, Dhaka",
  "latitude": 23.7949,
  "longitude": 90.4143,
  "accessInstructions": "Use the south gate"
}

### Request Provider membership in an existing canonical Property
POST {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties/{{propertyId}}/membership

### List membership-scoped Properties with governance context
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties

### Read one membership-scoped Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties/{{propertyId}}

### Leave Provider membership and end dependent live delegations/assignments
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/provider/properties/{{propertyId}}/membership

